        "locator": "lem:reparametrization",
        "text": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lem:reparametrization}\n\\uses{def:surrounds, def:average}\n\\lean{reparametrization}\n\\leanok\nLet $γ \\co E × 𝕊^1 → F$ be a smooth family of loops surrounding\na map $g$ with base $β$.\nThere is a family of circle diffeomorphisms $φ \\co E × 𝕊^1 → 𝕊^1$ such\nthat each $γ_x ∘ φ_x$ has average $g(x)$ and $φ_x(0) = 0$.\n\\end{lemma}",
